  "version": 1,
  "title": "Baire-measurable regularization on comeagre G-delta subspaces",
  "abstract": "For any topological source and second countable target, open inverse images have the property of Baire exactly when the function restricts continuously to some comeagre G-delta subspace. A Baire-source corollary also proves density. The countable basis synchronization and converse relative-open argument are proved internally.",
